# Impeccable Optimize Rules

Optimize means making the UI fast, smooth, and efficient.

---

## Core Principle

Performance is part of UX.

A slow UI is a bad UI.

---

## Reduce Work

- Avoid unnecessary renders
- Avoid heavy computations
- Only update what is needed

---

## Image Optimization

- Use optimized images
- Use correct sizes
- Avoid large images
- Use lazy loading

---

## Smooth Interaction

- Keep interactions responsive
- Avoid lag
- Use:
  - transform
  - opacity
- Avoid layout reflow animations

---

## Lazy Loading

- Load content only when needed
- Improve initial load time

---

## Avoid Heavy Effects

- Avoid complex animations
- Avoid large libraries if unnecessary

---

## Efficiency

- Keep components lightweight
- Keep logic simple
- Avoid over-engineering

---

## Constraints

- Do not change business logic
- Maintain readability
- Keep UI stable

---

## Goal

The UI should feel:

- fast
- smooth
- responsive
- efficient
